# Create Initiative (Project Overlay)

This is a **project overlay**. The full skill — progressive single-file initiative refinement ($Iteration_1 \rightarrow Iteration_N$), Given/When/Then templates, Ports/Adapters breakdown, 4 Production Readiness anchors — is provided by the `praxis` plugin's `create-initiative` skill. Read it first, then apply the overlay below.

## Project-specific paths

- Initiatives directory: `docs/product/initiatives/INIT.<initiative-name>.md`
- Product dashboard for registration: `{{paths.product_dashboard}}`
- Living capability records referenced: `docs/capabilities/CAP.<capability-name>.md`

## Project-specific rules

- Initiatives start **lean** on Iteration 1 (Summary, Hypothesis, Thin-Slices).
- **Anti-Over-Refinement Rule:** Never attempt to populate Iteration N architecture topology or NFR anchors up front for early exploratory spikes. Keep Iteration 1 lean; deepen specs only when thin-slices are triaged into active sprints.
